1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
<i>Somewhere a radio is playing.</i>

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,900
She says the river <b>always</b>
remembers its old path.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,700
<font color="#ffcc00">The kettle whistles twice.</font>

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
<i>Wait,</i> I said, <u>not yet</u>.
